// Tips: what every control does and how it works, in a student's words.
//
// An element names its tip with data-tip="key". Hovering or focusing it shows a card with these
// two sentences and, when there is one, a link to the full lesson; on a touch screen a tap on a
// label shows it. Explain mode (the header button) prints the first sentence under each control
// so a new student can read the whole screen without hovering anything.
//
// Each entry: [what it does, how it works or why it matters, lesson key or null].
// tests/test_tips.py checks every data-tip key used in the page exists here, every entry here is
// used, and every lesson key is a real lesson.
